  Dingjinjin-chihiro/crosspoint-reader, branch emulator-1.0.0.

Local changes in this repository
--------------------------------

Emulator side (see BUILD_NOTES.md for the full list):
  * portable MinGW-w64 build support (mkdir/realpath shims, forced standard
    includes, String 64-bit overloads)
  * optional framebuffer/texture dump switches for diagnostics

Firmware side (branch emulator-1.0.0):
  * fixes a use-after-free in onGoToReader()/onGoToMyLibraryWithPath()
  * adds a missing <cstdint> include in CrossPointState.h

